{"h01":{"text":"You're in a sea kayak on cold, glassy water.","speed":0.84,"dur":3.4,"raw":4.2,"lead":0.475,"words":[["You're",0.475,0.6375],["in",0.6375,0.7125],["a",0.7125,0.825],["sea",0.825,1.0625],["kayak",1.0625,1.5375],["on",1.5375,1.75],["cold,",1.75,2.375],["glassy",2.4625,3.0375],["water.",3.0375,3.875]]},"h02":{"text":"The sea is flat and your life jacket is zipped.","speed":0.84,"dur":3.175,"raw":3.9,"lead":0.425,"words":[["The",0.425,0.55],["sea",0.55,0.825],["is",0.825,1.025],["flat",1.025,1.5125],["and",1.5125,1.6375],["your",1.6375,1.8],["life",1.8,2.1125],["jacket",2.1125,2.575],["is",2.575,2.7625],["zipped.",2.7625,3.6]]},"h03":{"text":"And the one animal out here with killer in its name has never killed anyone in the wild.","speed":0.84,"dur":6.5,"raw":7.25,"lead":0.425,"words":[["And",0.425,0.5625],["the",0.5625,0.7],["one",0.7,1.075],["animal",1.075,1.5625],["out",1.5625,1.8625],["here",1.8625,2.175],["with",2.175,2.375],["killer",2.375,2.8],["in",2.8,2.9],["its",2.9,3.1],["name",3.1,3.975],["has",3.975,4.2125],["never",4.2125,4.575],["killed",4.575,5.15],["anyone",5.15,5.75],["in",5.75,5.8375],["the",5.8375,5.9625],["wild.",5.9625,6.925]]},"h04":{"text":"Then, through the thin plastic under your legs, you hear squeaks and creaks, like a rusty gate trying to sing.","speed":0.84,"dur":7.975,"raw":8.75,"lead":0.475,"words":[["Then,",0.475,0.725],["through",0.775,0.975],["the",0.975,1.15],["thin",1.15,1.5625],["plastic",1.5625,2.2],["under",2.2,2.425],["your",2.425,2.6],["legs,",2.6,3.525],["you",3.6625,3.825],["hear",3.825,4.075],["squeaks",4.075,4.675],["and",4.675,4.85],["creaks,",4.85,5.725],["like",5.85,6.05],["a",6.05,6.175],["rusty",6.175,6.7125],["gate",6.7125,7.05],["trying",7.05,7.425],["to",7.425,7.5875],["sing.",7.5875,8.45]]},"h05":{"text":"Then it all goes quiet.","speed":0.84,"dur":1.875,"raw":2.625,"lead":0.45,"words":[["Then",0.45,0.65],["it",0.65,0.7625],["all",0.7625,1.025],["goes",1.025,1.3625],["quiet.",1.3625,2.325]]},"h06":{"text":"That quiet is a pod of orcas, deciding something about you.","speed":0.84,"dur":4.525,"raw":5.3,"lead":0.45,"words":[["That",0.45,0.7375],["quiet",0.7375,1.25],["is",1.25,1.3625],["a",1.3625,1.4625],["pod",1.4625,1.7875],["of",1.7875,1.9125],["orcas,",1.9125,2.8],["deciding",2.925,3.5375],["something",3.5375,3.925],["about",3.925,4.3],["you.",4.3,4.975]]},"r01":{"text":"Sharks bite around sixty to seventy people a year, unprovoked. The orca, the one called killer, sits on zero.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.65,"raw":8.375,"lead":0.45,"words":[["Sharks",0.45,0.8125],["bite",0.8125,1.075],["around",1.075,1.45],["sixty",1.45,1.9],["to",1.9,2.0375],["seventy",2.0375,2.425],["people",2.425,2.775],["a",2.775,2.8875],["year,",2.8875,3.375],["unprovoked.",3.475,4.625],["The",4.7625,4.9375],["orca,",4.9375,5.45],["the",5.525,5.625],["one",5.625,5.85],["called",5.85,6.1875],["killer,",6.1875,6.65],["sits",6.7375,7.05],["on",7.05,7.2625],["zero.",7.2625,8.1]]},"r02":{"text":"So why has an animal built for killing never picked you?","speed":0.96,"dur":3.575,"raw":4.3,"lead":0.4,"words":[["So",0.4,0.575],["why",0.575,0.8],["has",0.8,1.0125],["an",1.0125,1.1875],["animal",1.1875,1.9],["built",1.9,2.225],["for",2.225,2.3875],["killing",2.3875,2.8125],["never",2.8125,3.1375],["picked",3.1375,3.45],["you?",3.45,3.975]]},"r03":{"text":"It's not that it can't. It surfs onto beaches for sea lions, leaves great whites washed up without their livers, and has taken down the largest animal that ever lived.","speed":0.96,"dur":11.6,"raw":12.25,"lead":0.35,"words":[["It's",0.35,0.575],["not",0.575,0.8],["that",0.8,0.95],["it",0.95,1.1125],["can't.",1.1125,1.95],["It",2.075,2.3],["surfs",2.3,2.675],["onto",2.675,3.0375],["beaches",3.0375,3.525],["for",3.525,3.7125],["sea",3.7125,4.0125],["lions,",4.0125,4.9],["leaves",5.075,5.5625],["great",5.5625,5.9375],["whites",5.9375,6.3125],["washed",6.3125,6.6875],["up",6.6875,6.8625],["without",6.8625,7.2],["their",7.2,7.4125],["livers,",7.4125,8.15],["and",8.25,8.3625],["has",8.3625,8.5375],["taken",8.5375,8.95],["down",8.95,9.325],["the",9.325,9.475],["largest",9.475,10.1],["animal",10.1,10.575],["that",10.575,10.7625],["ever",10.7625,11.0875],["lived.",11.0875,11.95]]},"p01":{"text":"So let's open its threat file, one tab at a time.","speed":0.96,"dur":3.625,"raw":4.3,"lead":0.4,"words":[["So",0.4,0.525],["let's",0.525,0.8],["open",0.8,1.0875],["its",1.0875,1.275],["threat",1.275,1.5625],["file,",1.5625,2.175],["one",2.3125,2.6125],["tab",2.6125,3.025],["at",3.025,3.1125],["a",3.1125,3.1875],["time.",3.1875,4.025]]},"b01":{"text":"Tab one, the body. A big male runs about eight metres long and weighs around six tonnes.","speed":0.96,"dur":6.225,"raw":6.875,"lead":0.375,"words":[["Tab",0.375,0.6875],["one,",0.6875,1.025],["the",1.075,1.175],["body.",1.175,1.95],["A",2.1125,2.2375],["big",2.2375,2.5],["male",2.5,2.875],["runs",2.875,3.1125],["about",3.1125,3.4375],["eight",3.4375,3.7],["metres",3.7,4.0875],["long",4.0875,4.5],["and",4.5,4.625],["weighs",4.625,4.95],["around",4.95,5.375],["six",5.375,5.7125],["tonnes.",5.7125,6.6]]},"b02":{"text":"That's nearly two family cars nose to tail, as heavy as four of them.","speed":0.96,"dur":4.95,"raw":5.625,"lead":0.4,"words":[["That's",0.4,0.6875],["nearly",0.6875,1.1],["two",1.1,1.3875],["family",1.3875,1.8125],["cars",1.8125,2.225],["nose",2.225,2.575],["to",2.575,2.7125],["tail,",2.7125,3.425],["as",3.5625,3.7375],["heavy",3.7375,4.1],["as",4.1,4.275],["four",4.275,4.6125],["of",4.6125,4.75],["them.",4.75,5.35]]},"b03":{"text":"His dorsal fin alone can stand about as tall as you.","speed":0.96,"dur":3.575,"raw":4.25,"lead":0.375,"words":[["His",0.375,0.5625],["dorsal",0.5625,1.075],["fin",1.075,1.35],["alone",1.35,1.9],["can",1.9,2.1],["stand",2.1,2.4375],["about",2.4375,2.725],["as",2.725,2.8875],["tall",2.8875,3.2],["as",3.2,3.3625],["you.",3.3625,3.95]]},"b04":{"text":"Inside the mouth sit up to fifty-six cone-shaped teeth, the biggest around ten centimetres, longer than your credit card.","speed":0.96,"dur":8.5,"raw":9.225,"lead":0.425,"words":[["Inside",0.425,1.0],["the",1.0,1.1375],["mouth",1.1375,1.55],["sit",1.55,1.7625],["up",1.7625,1.95],["to",1.95,2.0875],["fifty-six",2.0875,2.8125],["cone-shaped",2.8125,3.525],["teeth,",3.525,4.275],["the",4.4,4.5375],["biggest",4.5375,5.0],["around",5.0,5.4375],["ten",5.4375,5.7875],["centimetres,",5.7875,6.75],["longer",6.9,7.4],["than",7.4,7.55],["your",7.55,7.725],["credit",7.725,8.1125],["card.",8.1125,8.925]]},"b05":{"text":"They interlock when the jaw closes and aren't made for chewing, so you'd be held, torn and swallowed in chunks.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.125,"raw":7.775,"lead":0.375,"words":[["They",0.375,0.525],["interlock",0.525,1.1125],["when",1.1125,1.2375],["the",1.2375,1.3375],["jaw",1.3375,1.6625],["closes",1.6625,2.25],["and",2.25,2.375],["aren't",2.375,2.575],["made",2.575,2.825],["for",2.825,3.0],["chewing,",3.0,3.8],["so",3.9375,4.125],["you'd",4.125,4.3],["be",4.3,4.4625],["held,",4.4625,5.175],["torn",5.3125,5.775],["and",5.775,5.925],["swallowed",5.925,6.5],["in",6.5,6.675],["chunks.",6.675,7.5]]},"b06":{"text":"It isn't even a whale. It's the biggest dolphin there is, and there's also a false killer whale and a pygmy one, so somebody was nervous.","speed":0.96,"dur":9.0,"raw":9.65,"lead":0.375,"words":[["It",0.375,0.4875],["isn't",0.4875,0.725],["even",0.725,0.975],["a",0.975,1.0875],["whale.",1.0875,1.95],["It's",2.075,2.325],["the",2.325,2.4625],["biggest",2.4625,2.8625],["dolphin",2.8625,3.375],["there",3.375,3.625],["is,",3.625,4.2],["and",4.3,4.4125],["there's",4.4125,4.6375],["also",4.6375,5.075],["a",5.075,5.2],["false",5.2,5.6375],["killer",5.6375,6.0],["whale",6.0,6.4],["and",6.4,6.5125],["a",6.5125,6.6125],["pygmy",6.6125,7.05],["one,",7.05,7.45],["so",7.5625,7.8],["somebody",7.8,8.225],["was",8.225,8.4375],["nervous.",8.4375,9.375]]},"s01":{"text":"So could you outswim one? No.","speed":0.96,"dur":2.2,"raw":2.9,"lead":0.4,"words":[["So",0.4,0.575],["could",0.575,0.75],["you",0.75,0.8875],["outswim",0.8875,1.35],["one?",1.35,1.8],["No.",1.9375,2.6]]},"s02":{"text":"In a sprint an orca hits about fifty-six kilometres an hour, the speed you'd drive through town.","speed":0.96,"dur":6.3,"raw":6.975,"lead":0.4,"words":[["In",0.4,0.4875],["a",0.4875,0.5875],["sprint",0.5875,0.95],["an",0.95,1.1],["orca",1.1,1.5375],["hits",1.5375,1.8125],["about",1.8125,2.1375],["fifty-six",2.1375,2.75],["kilometres",2.75,3.425],["an",3.425,3.575],["hour,",3.575,4.3],["the",4.425,4.5625],["speed",4.5625,4.975],["you'd",4.975,5.1875],["drive",5.1875,5.6125],["through",5.6125,5.8375],["town.",5.8375,6.7]]},"s03":{"text":"The fastest human swimmers manage about eight. You, in a borrowed wetsuit, maybe three.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.9,"raw":6.55,"lead":0.375,"words":[["The",0.375,0.4875],["fastest",0.4875,0.975],["human",0.975,1.3625],["swimmers",1.3625,1.8125],["manage",1.8125,2.2125],["about",2.2125,2.5],["eight.",2.5,3.125],["You,",3.275,3.825],["in",3.975,4.0625],["a",4.0625,4.1625],["borrowed",4.1625,4.675],["wetsuit,",4.675,5.125],["maybe",5.175,5.525],["three.",5.525,6.275]]},"s04":{"text":"All that speed burns fuel, and a big adult can eat up to about a hundred and thirty kilos on a big day, more than you weigh.","speed":0.96,"dur":8.4,"raw":9.1,"lead":0.425,"words":[["All",0.425,0.65],["that",0.65,0.8875],["speed",0.8875,1.3625],["burns",1.3625,1.7875],["fuel,",1.7875,2.625],["and",2.725,2.8375],["a",2.8375,2.9375],["big",2.9375,3.175],["adult",3.175,3.575],["can",3.575,3.7875],["eat",3.7875,3.9625],["up",3.9625,4.15],["to",4.15,4.3],["about",4.3,4.5375],["a",4.5375,4.65],["hundred",4.65,5.15],["and",5.15,5.3],["thirty",5.3,5.6625],["kilos",5.6625,6.2375],["on",6.2375,6.3625],["a",6.3625,6.4625],["big",6.4625,6.7125],["day,",6.7125,7.35],["more",7.5125,7.775],["than",7.775,7.925],["you",7.925,8.0875],["weigh.",8.0875,8.825]]},"s05":{"text":"So you'd be a perfectly sized meal. It's just never ordered one.","speed":0.96,"dur":4.5,"raw":5.175,"lead":0.4,"words":[["So",0.4,0.55],["you'd",0.55,0.725],["be",0.725,0.875],["a",0.875,0.9875],["perfectly",0.9875,1.6],["sized",1.6,2.1125],["meal.",2.1125,2.775],["It's",2.9,3.125],["just",3.125,3.3875],["never",3.3875,3.7375],["ordered",3.7375,4.1875],["one.",4.1875,4.9]]},"pl01":{"text":"But speed isn't what makes it dangerous. It plans.","speed":0.96,"dur":3.475,"raw":4.125,"lead":0.35,"words":[["But",0.35,0.5125],["speed",0.5125,0.925],["isn't",0.925,1.1625],["what",1.1625,1.3],["makes",1.3,1.5625],["it",1.5625,1.65],["dangerous.",1.65,2.55],["It",2.675,2.8625],["plans.",2.8625,3.825]]},"pl02":{"text":"Orcas live in family pods led by older females, and in the North Pacific some eat only fish while others eat only mammals.","speed":0.96,"dur":9.275,"raw":9.95,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Orcas",0.4,0.85],["live",0.85,1.2],["in",1.2,1.3625],["family",1.3625,1.8375],["pods",1.8375,2.325],["led",2.325,2.55],["by",2.55,2.7625],["older",2.7625,3.2],["females,",3.2,4.225],["and",4.35,4.4625],["in",4.4625,4.5375],["the",4.5375,4.625],["North",4.625,4.9],["Pacific",4.9,5.85],["some",5.85,6.1875],["eat",6.1875,6.5625],["only",6.5625,6.9375],["fish",6.9375,7.45],["while",7.45,7.6875],["others",7.6875,8.1125],["eat",8.1125,8.375],["only",8.375,8.6875],["mammals.",8.6875,9.675]]},"pl04":{"text":"The fish eaters chatter all day, since salmon barely hear them. Mammal hunters can't, because seals hear orca calls well, so these pods hunt in near silence, by listening.","speed":0.96,"dur":11.9,"raw":12.55,"lead":0.375,"words":[["The",0.375,0.4875],["fish",0.4875,0.8],["eaters",0.8,1.1625],["chatter",1.1625,1.55],["all",1.55,1.8],["day,",1.8,2.275],["since",2.4125,2.65],["salmon",2.65,3.0875],["barely",3.0875,3.4875],["hear",3.4875,3.775],["them.",3.775,4.475],["Mammal",4.65,5.05],["hunters",5.05,5.5125],["can't,",5.5125,6.175],["because",6.275,6.675],["seals",6.675,7.15],["hear",7.15,7.4625],["orca",7.4625,7.8625],["calls",7.8625,8.2625],["well,",8.2625,8.85],["so",8.9625,9.15],["these",9.15,9.4125],["pods",9.4125,9.9125],["hunt",9.9125,10.225],["in",10.225,10.35],["near",10.35,10.6],["silence,",10.6,11.15],["by",11.2,11.4],["listening.",11.4,12.275]]},"pl06":{"text":"Underwater microphones show most of their calling starts after the kill.","speed":0.96,"dur":4.8,"raw":5.475,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Underwater",0.4,1.05],["microphones",1.05,2.1875],["show",2.1875,2.5125],["most",2.5125,2.8375],["of",2.8375,2.9125],["their",2.9125,3.1125],["calling",3.1125,3.6125],["starts",3.6125,4.0375],["after",4.0375,4.3375],["the",4.3375,4.4625],["kill.",4.4625,5.2]]},"pl07":{"text":"Remember the squeaking through your kayak, and then the silence?","speed":0.96,"dur":3.725,"raw":4.4,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Remember",0.4,0.75],["the",0.75,0.8875],["squeaking",0.8875,1.4],["through",1.4,1.6],["your",1.6,1.7875],["kayak,",1.7875,2.625],["and",2.75,2.8625],["then",2.8625,2.9875],["the",2.9875,3.125],["silence?",3.125,4.125]]},"pl08":{"text":"Noisy is an orca off duty. Quiet is an orca at work.","speed":0.96,"dur":3.975,"raw":4.7,"lead":0.425,"words":[["Noisy",0.425,0.925],["is",0.925,1.0375],["an",1.0375,1.1625],["orca",1.1625,1.5],["off",1.5,1.7375],["duty.",1.7375,2.325],["Quiet",2.4875,2.95],["is",2.95,3.0625],["an",3.0625,3.2125],["orca",3.2125,3.5875],["at",3.5875,3.75],["work.",3.75,4.4]]},"pl09":{"text":"And the planning gets taught. In Argentina, orcas surf up the beach to grab young sea lions, then slide back on the next wave.","speed":0.96,"dur":8.975,"raw":9.65,"lead":0.375,"words":[["And",0.375,0.4875],["the",0.4875,0.5875],["planning",0.5875,1.075],["gets",1.075,1.3375],["taught.",1.3375,2.125],["In",2.2625,2.425],["Argentina,",2.425,3.325],["orcas",3.4375,3.8625],["surf",3.8625,4.1375],["up",4.1375,4.3],["the",4.3,4.4375],["beach",4.4375,4.775],["to",4.775,4.9125],["grab",4.9125,5.3625],["young",5.3625,5.7375],["sea",5.7375,6.0375],["lions,",6.0375,6.9],["then",7.0,7.25],["slide",7.25,7.7],["back",7.7,8.0375],["on",8.0375,8.1375],["the",8.1375,8.225],["next",8.225,8.55],["wave.",8.55,9.35]]},"pl10":{"text":"On the Crozet Islands, mothers have been seen pushing calves up the sand, and calves rehearse on empty beaches.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.575,"raw":8.225,"lead":0.375,"words":[["On",0.375,0.4875],["the",0.4875,0.575],["Crozet",0.575,1.0875],["Islands,",1.0875,1.975],["mothers",2.125,2.5375],["have",2.5375,2.65],["been",2.65,2.8625],["seen",2.8625,3.1875],["pushing",3.1875,3.6625],["calves",3.6625,4.0375],["up",4.0375,4.2],["the",4.2,4.35],["sand,",4.35,5.175],["and",5.3125,5.4625],["calves",5.4625,5.825],["rehearse",5.825,6.4],["on",6.4,6.6125],["empty",6.6125,6.975],["beaches.",6.975,7.95]]},"w01":{"text":"In Antarctica, a seal can escape all that by hauling out onto floating ice. Smart.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.8,"raw":6.475,"lead":0.4,"words":[["In",0.4,0.5],["Antarctica,",0.5,1.425],["a",1.5625,1.7],["seal",1.7,2.05],["can",2.05,2.1625],["escape",2.1625,2.6],["all",2.6,2.85],["that",2.85,3.0],["by",3.0,3.1875],["hauling",3.1875,3.6],["out",3.6,3.7875],["onto",3.7875,4.0375],["floating",4.0375,4.4375],["ice.",4.4375,5.175],["Smart.",5.3625,6.2]]},"w02":{"text":"Except a pod swims up, lifts their heads out of the water, and takes a look first.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.225,"raw":5.9,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Except",0.4,0.7375],["a",0.7375,0.8375],["pod",0.8375,1.2875],["swims",1.2875,1.725],["up,",1.725,2.225],["lifts",2.3625,2.7],["their",2.7,2.9],["heads",2.9,3.25],["out",3.25,3.3875],["of",3.3875,3.4625],["the",3.4625,3.5875],["water,",3.5875,4.025],["and",4.075,4.2],["takes",4.2,4.4875],["a",4.4875,4.575],["look",4.575,4.8125],["first.",4.8125,5.625]]},"w03":{"text":"Scientists noticed they kept choosing Weddell seals, even where others were easier to find.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.85,"raw":6.575,"lead":0.425,"words":[["Scientists",0.425,1.0375],["noticed",1.0375,1.45],["they",1.45,1.6],["kept",1.6,1.8875],["choosing",1.8875,2.3375],["Weddell",2.3375,2.7],["seals,",2.7,3.55],["even",3.6875,4.0],["where",4.0,4.2125],["others",4.2125,4.6],["were",4.6,4.8],["easier",4.8,5.25],["to",5.25,5.3875],["find.",5.3875,6.275]]},"w04":{"text":"Then the pod backs off, lines up, and charges together. At the last second they dive, and their wave rolls over the floe and tips the seal in.","speed":0.96,"dur":9.75,"raw":10.4,"lead":0.375,"words":[["Then",0.375,0.4875],["the",0.4875,0.5875],["pod",0.5875,0.975],["backs",0.975,1.325],["off,",1.325,1.875],["lines",1.9875,2.45],["up,",2.45,2.675],["and",2.7125,2.8375],["charges",2.8375,3.3],["together.",3.3,4.2],["At",4.3625,4.55],["the",4.55,4.6875],["last",4.6875,5.0875],["second",5.0875,5.45],["they",5.45,5.6125],["dive,",5.6125,6.35],["and",6.45,6.5625],["their",6.5625,6.75],["wave",6.75,7.2375],["rolls",7.2375,7.65],["over",7.65,7.8625],["the",7.8625,8.0],["floe",8.0,8.475],["and",8.475,8.6125],["tips",8.6125,8.925],["the",8.925,9.075],["seal",9.075,9.45],["in.",9.45,10.125]]},"w06":{"text":"If it fails, they go again. A seal on an ice floe isn't safe. It's served.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.4,"raw":6.05,"lead":0.375,"words":[["If",0.375,0.5125],["it",0.5125,0.6625],["fails,",0.6625,1.1],["they",1.1375,1.275],["go",1.275,1.5],["again.",1.5,2.1],["A",2.2375,2.375],["seal",2.375,2.7375],["on",2.7375,2.8625],["an",2.8625,3.0],["ice",3.0,3.3375],["floe",3.3375,3.7],["isn't",3.7,3.9875],["safe.",3.9875,4.575],["It's",4.675,4.925],["served.",4.925,5.775]]},"w07":{"text":"Now picture your kayak again: a small flat thing on the water, with something warm on top. Look familiar?","speed":0.96,"dur":7.125,"raw":7.825,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Now",0.4,0.6125],["picture",0.6125,1.0],["your",1.0,1.1625],["kayak",1.1625,1.625],["again:",1.625,2.275],["a",2.4125,2.5375],["small",2.5375,2.95],["flat",2.95,3.3375],["thing",3.3375,3.5375],["on",3.5375,3.6375],["the",3.6375,3.7625],["water,",3.7625,4.175],["with",4.2125,4.375],["something",4.375,4.8],["warm",4.8,5.2125],["on",5.2125,5.4125],["top.",5.4125,6.1],["Look",6.275,6.5375],["familiar?",6.5375,7.525]]},"k01":{"text":"Which brings us back to those sharks.","speed":0.96,"dur":2.125,"raw":2.775,"lead":0.375,"words":[["Which",0.375,0.6],["brings",0.6,0.8625],["us",0.8625,1.025],["back",1.025,1.3],["to",1.3,1.4],["those",1.4,1.675],["sharks.",1.675,2.5]]},"k02":{"text":"In one week in May 2017, three great whites washed up near Gansbaai, South Africa.","speed":0.96,"dur":6.475,"raw":7.2,"lead":0.425,"words":[["In",0.425,0.55],["one",0.55,0.775],["week",0.775,1.025],["in",1.025,1.15],["May",1.15,1.4],["2017,",1.4,2.75],["three",2.925,3.2125],["great",3.2125,3.5625],["whites",3.5625,3.9625],["washed",3.9625,4.3375],["up",4.3375,4.525],["near",4.525,4.7625],["Gansbaai,",4.7625,5.5],["South",5.6125,5.9625],["Africa.",5.9625,6.9]]},"k03":{"text":"Each had wounds near the front fins and no liver, and at least one had lost its heart too.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.75,"raw":6.45,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Each",0.4,0.65],["had",0.65,0.875],["wounds",0.875,1.4],["near",1.4,1.6125],["the",1.6125,1.7125],["front",1.7125,2.05],["fins",2.05,2.575],["and",2.575,2.7],["no",2.7,2.9375],["liver,",2.9375,3.625],["and",3.7625,3.8875],["at",3.8875,3.975],["least",3.975,4.3],["one",4.3,4.4625],["had",4.4625,4.625],["lost",4.625,4.9625],["its",4.9625,5.125],["heart",5.125,5.425],["too.",5.425,6.15]]},"k04":{"text":"The suspects were two local males, Port and Starboard, named for their floppy dorsal fins.","speed":0.96,"dur":6.2,"raw":6.85,"lead":0.375,"words":[["The",0.375,0.4875],["suspects",0.4875,1.025],["were",1.025,1.2],["two",1.2,1.475],["local",1.475,1.825],["males,",1.825,2.425],["Port",2.5375,2.875],["and",2.875,3.0125],["Starboard,",3.0125,3.975],["named",4.1125,4.425],["for",4.425,4.5375],["their",4.5375,4.75],["floppy",4.75,5.2375],["dorsal",5.2375,5.7],["fins.",5.7,6.575]]},"k05":{"text":"Why the liver? In a great white it can be a quarter of the body, and it's full of oil.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.3,"raw":5.975,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Why",0.4,0.625],["the",0.625,0.7625],["liver?",0.7625,1.425],["In",1.5875,1.725],["a",1.725,1.8375],["great",1.8375,2.2125],["white",2.2125,2.4625],["it",2.4625,2.55],["can",2.55,2.7],["be",2.7,2.85],["a",2.85,2.9625],["quarter",2.9625,3.4125],["of",3.4125,3.4875],["the",3.4875,3.6125],["body,",3.6125,4.125],["and",4.2,4.3125],["it's",4.3125,4.5125],["full",4.5125,4.7625],["of",4.7625,4.9125],["oil.",4.9125,5.7]]},"k06":{"text":"Think of it as the shark's fuel tank. The orcas take the tank and leave the car.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.175,"raw":5.85,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Think",0.4,0.575],["of",0.575,0.7],["it",0.7,0.8625],["as",0.8625,1.025],["the",1.025,1.175],["shark's",1.175,1.5875],["fuel",1.5875,1.9375],["tank.",1.9375,2.65],["The",2.7875,2.9625],["orcas",2.9625,3.5],["take",3.5,3.75],["the",3.75,3.8625],["tank",3.8625,4.225],["and",4.225,4.35],["leave",4.35,4.6375],["the",4.6375,4.7625],["car.",4.7625,5.575]]},"k07":{"text":"Scientists suspect they flip sharks into a trance called tonic immobility, though that is still unconfirmed.","speed":0.96,"dur":6.75,"raw":7.45,"lead":0.425,"words":[["Scientists",0.425,0.975],["suspect",0.975,1.45],["they",1.45,1.6125],["flip",1.6125,1.925],["sharks",1.925,2.2875],["into",2.2875,2.5125],["a",2.5125,2.575],["trance",2.575,2.975],["called",2.975,3.325],["tonic",3.325,3.75],["immobility,",3.75,4.85],["though",4.975,5.15],["that",5.15,5.425],["is",5.425,5.5625],["still",5.5625,5.9375],["unconfirmed.",5.9375,7.175]]},"k08":{"text":"What is on film is Starboard, in 2023, killing a young great white alone in under two minutes, less time than you spend brushing your teeth.","speed":0.96,"dur":9.9,"raw":10.6,"lead":0.4,"words":[["What",0.4,0.55],["is",0.55,0.7],["on",0.7,0.95],["film",0.95,1.375],["is",1.375,1.5125],["Starboard,",1.5125,2.3],["in",2.35,2.5125],["2023,",2.5125,3.9],["killing",4.0875,4.475],["a",4.475,4.6],["young",4.6,4.9875],["great",4.9875,5.3625],["white",5.3625,5.65],["alone",5.65,6.175],["in",6.175,6.2625],["under",6.2625,6.5125],["two",6.5125,6.725],["minutes,",6.725,7.5],["less",7.6375,7.9375],["time",7.9375,8.3125],["than",8.3125,8.425],["you",8.425,8.55],["spend",8.55,8.9375],["brushing",8.9375,9.35],["your",9.35,9.5125],["teeth.",9.5125,10.3]]},"k09":{"text":"And the sharks? They left, for months at a time, so a cage dive there could mean you staring at empty water all day.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.475,"raw":8.125,"lead":0.375,"words":[["And",0.375,0.5125],["the",0.5125,0.65],["sharks?",0.65,1.475],["They",1.6,1.7875],["left,",1.7875,2.175],["for",2.225,2.3875],["months",2.3875,2.6625],["at",2.6625,2.7375],["a",2.7375,2.8125],["time,",2.8125,3.4],["so",3.475,3.65],["a",3.65,3.7625],["cage",3.7625,4.2375],["dive",4.2375,4.65],["there",4.65,4.85],["could",4.85,5.05],["mean",5.05,5.275],["you",5.275,5.45],["staring",5.45,5.95],["at",5.95,6.0875],["empty",6.0875,6.4875],["water",6.4875,6.9],["all",6.9,7.15],["day.",7.15,7.85]]},"k11":{"text":"Imagine being the most feared fish in the ocean and moving house because of a dolphin.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.525,"raw":6.2,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Imagine",0.4,0.925],["being",0.925,1.1875],["the",1.1875,1.275],["most",1.275,1.575],["feared",1.575,1.975],["fish",1.975,2.3125],["in",2.3125,2.3875],["the",2.3875,2.525],["ocean",2.525,3.1],["and",3.1,3.225],["moving",3.225,3.5875],["house",3.5875,4.35],["because",4.35,4.7875],["of",4.7875,4.8625],["a",4.8625,4.9625],["dolphin.",4.9625,5.925]]},"g01":{"text":"Think being huge would save you?","speed":0.96,"dur":1.925,"raw":2.6,"lead":0.375,"words":[["Think",0.375,0.575],["being",0.575,0.8875],["huge",0.8875,1.275],["would",1.275,1.4625],["save",1.4625,1.8],["you?",1.8,2.3]]},"g02":{"text":"In March 2019, off Bremer Bay in Western Australia, more than a dozen orcas brought down an adult blue whale around twenty metres long.","speed":0.96,"dur":10.325,"raw":11.025,"lead":0.425,"words":[["In",0.425,0.525],["March",0.525,0.8625],["2019,",0.8625,2.15],["off",2.3125,2.6375],["Bremer",2.6375,3.0375],["Bay",3.0375,3.425],["in",3.425,3.575],["Western",3.575,4.0375],["Australia,",4.0375,5.05],["more",5.2125,5.475],["than",5.475,5.6],["a",5.6,5.725],["dozen",5.725,6.1875],["orcas",6.1875,6.7375],["brought",6.7375,7.0625],["down",7.0625,7.45],["an",7.45,7.55],["adult",7.55,8.0125],["blue",8.0125,8.3375],["whale",8.3375,8.8],["around",8.8,9.1875],["twenty",9.1875,9.55],["metres",9.55,9.9375],["long.",9.9375,10.75]]},"g03":{"text":"Line up eleven of you head to toe and you'd only just match it.","speed":0.96,"dur":3.975,"raw":4.675,"lead":0.425,"words":[["Line",0.425,0.6875],["up",0.6875,0.875],["eleven",0.875,1.2625],["of",1.2625,1.35],["you",1.35,1.5],["head",1.5,1.725],["to",1.725,1.8625],["toe",1.8625,2.6375],["and",2.6375,2.8],["you'd",2.8,2.925],["only",2.925,3.225],["just",3.225,3.4875],["match",3.4875,3.9],["it.",3.9,4.4]]},"g04":{"text":"They took turns biting its fins and flanks and pushing it under until it gave out.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.25,"raw":5.9,"lead":0.375,"words":[["They",0.375,0.5375],["took",0.5375,0.8125],["turns",0.8125,1.3375],["biting",1.3375,1.7],["its",1.7,1.925],["fins",1.925,2.3875],["and",2.3875,2.525],["flanks",2.525,3.35],["and",3.35,3.5125],["pushing",3.5125,3.8875],["it",3.8875,3.975],["under",3.975,4.3125],["until",4.3125,4.6125],["it",4.6125,4.7],["gave",4.7,5.0],["out.",5.0,5.625]]},"g05":{"text":"It was the first ever documented, and it has happened twice more since, both to young whales.","speed":0.96,"dur":6.2,"raw":6.85,"lead":0.375,"words":[["It",0.375,0.4875],["was",0.4875,0.65],["the",0.65,0.8],["first",0.8,1.2125],["ever",1.2125,1.5375],["documented,",1.5375,2.625],["and",2.75,2.8625],["it",2.8625,2.9375],["has",2.9375,3.1],["happened",3.1,3.4875],["twice",3.4875,3.9],["more",3.9,4.15],["since,",4.15,4.775],["both",4.9125,5.225],["to",5.225,5.35],["young",5.35,5.6375],["whales.",5.6375,6.575]]},"g06":{"text":"So size doesn't stop it, and nothing in the sea hunts it back. Which makes your seventy-odd kilos a strange exception.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.65,"raw":8.325,"lead":0.4,"words":[["So",0.4,0.6],["size",0.6,1.025],["doesn't",1.025,1.3625],["stop",1.3625,1.775],["it,",1.775,2.125],["and",2.2125,2.3625],["nothing",2.3625,2.775],["in",2.775,2.8625],["the",2.8625,3.0],["sea",3.0,3.3],["hunts",3.3,3.5875],["it",3.5875,3.7],["back.",3.7,4.425],["Which",4.5625,4.775],["makes",4.775,5.0125],["your",5.0125,5.175],["seventy-odd",5.175,5.9375],["kilos",5.9375,6.45],["a",6.45,6.5625],["strange",6.5625,7.075],["exception.",7.075,8.05]]},"pr01":{"text":"So has an orca ever turned any of this on a person?","speed":0.96,"dur":3.75,"raw":4.425,"lead":0.4,"words":[["So",0.4,0.525],["has",0.525,0.7625],["an",0.7625,0.925],["orca",0.925,1.6375],["ever",1.6375,1.9875],["turned",1.9875,2.3875],["any",2.3875,2.6625],["of",2.6625,2.775],["this",2.775,3.05],["on",3.05,3.1875],["a",3.1875,3.2625],["person?",3.2625,4.15]]},"pr02":{"text":"A handful of bites and bumps are on record, and no deaths. The closest call is in an explorer's diary.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.425,"raw":8.1,"lead":0.4,"words":[["A",0.4,0.4875],["handful",0.4875,1.05],["of",1.05,1.2125],["bites",1.2125,1.625],["and",1.625,1.7625],["bumps",1.7625,2.15],["are",2.15,2.275],["on",2.275,2.5125],["record,",2.5125,3.225],["and",3.3375,3.4875],["no",3.4875,3.7625],["deaths.",3.7625,4.625],["The",4.7625,4.9125],["closest",4.9125,5.4375],["call",5.4375,5.8625],["is",5.8625,6.0375],["in",6.0375,6.1625],["an",6.1625,6.25],["explorer's",6.25,6.9625],["diary.",6.9625,7.825]]},"pr03":{"text":"In January 1911, on Scott's Antarctic expedition, photographer Herbert Ponting walked onto the sea ice to photograph a pod.","speed":0.96,"dur":9.8,"raw":10.525,"lead":0.425,"words":[["In",0.425,0.5625],["January",0.5625,1.125],["1911,",1.125,2.375],["on",2.5,2.725],["Scott's",2.725,3.2125],["Antarctic",3.2125,3.85],["expedition,",3.85,5.025],["photographer",5.1625,5.9875],["Herbert",5.9875,6.4375],["Ponting",6.4375,7.0625],["walked",7.0625,7.425],["onto",7.425,7.675],["the",7.675,7.8375],["sea",7.8375,8.1375],["ice",8.1375,8.45],["to",8.45,8.5875],["photograph",8.5875,9.25],["a",9.25,9.3625],["pod.",9.3625,10.225]]},"pr04":{"text":"Seconds later the ice under him heaved and split, broken from below, the same idea as the floe trick.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.175,"raw":7.9,"lead":0.425,"words":[["Seconds",0.425,0.8375],["later",0.8375,1.1125],["the",1.1125,1.2625],["ice",1.2625,1.5375],["under",1.5375,1.75],["him",1.75,2.0],["heaved",2.0,2.55],["and",2.55,2.7125],["split,",2.7125,3.475],["broken",3.6125,4.05],["from",4.05,4.225],["below,",4.225,4.975],["the",5.125,5.275],["same",5.275,5.65],["idea",5.65,6.2125],["as",6.2125,6.375],["the",6.375,6.5125],["floe",6.5125,6.8625],["trick.",6.8625,7.6]]},"pr05":{"text":"Ponting leapt slab to slab and made it back, off ice thick enough to hold sled dogs. You'd have a few millimetres of plastic.","speed":0.96,"dur":8.55,"raw":9.2,"lead":0.375,"words":[["Ponting",0.375,0.825],["leapt",0.825,1.1125],["slab",1.1125,1.55],["to",1.55,1.7],["slab",1.7,2.1875],["and",2.1875,2.3],["made",2.3,2.5125],["it",2.5125,2.625],["back,",2.625,3.275],["off",3.4125,3.675],["ice",3.675,4.05],["thick",4.05,4.2875],["enough",4.2875,4.575],["to",4.575,4.7],["hold",4.7,5.025],["sled",5.025,5.4125],["dogs.",5.4125,6.325],["You'd",6.4625,6.625],["have",6.625,6.8125],["a",6.8125,6.8875],["few",6.8875,7.1375],["millimetres",7.1375,7.7875],["of",7.7875,7.9125],["plastic.",7.9125,8.925]]},"pr07":{"text":"Were they after him, his dogs, or a dark shape on the ice? Nobody knows.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.05,"raw":5.7,"lead":0.375,"words":[["Were",0.375,0.5],["they",0.5,0.7125],["after",0.7125,1.1],["him,",1.1,1.375],["his",1.45,1.6625],["dogs,",1.6625,2.15],["or",2.2,2.325],["a",2.325,2.4375],["dark",2.4375,2.7625],["shape",2.7625,3.0375],["on",3.0375,3.1375],["the",3.1375,3.275],["ice?",3.275,3.95],["Nobody",4.125,4.575],["knows.",4.575,5.425]]},"pr08":{"text":"Could it? Clearly. Has it? Wild orcas, human deaths: zero.","speed":0.96,"dur":4.025,"raw":4.7,"lead":0.375,"words":[["Could",0.375,0.55],["it?",0.55,0.65],["Clearly.",0.7125,1.15],["Has",1.2,1.475],["it?",1.475,1.7],["Wild",1.8125,2.175],["orcas,",2.175,2.55],["human",2.6,2.95],["deaths:",2.95,3.425],["zero.",3.55,4.4]]},"c01":{"text":"Still, run the thought experiment. A pod has picked you, and you get four moves.","speed":0.96,"dur":4.8,"raw":5.475,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Still,",0.4,0.775],["run",0.825,1.0625],["the",1.0625,1.1875],["thought",1.1875,1.4375],["experiment.",1.4375,2.35],["A",2.4875,2.6125],["pod",2.6125,2.9625],["has",2.9625,3.1375],["picked",3.1375,3.45],["you,",3.45,3.575],["and",3.6125,3.7125],["you",3.7125,3.825],["get",3.825,4.0375],["four",4.0375,4.3375],["moves.",4.3375,5.2]]},"c02":{"text":"One, swim for it: fifty-six against your three. That's not a race, it's a delivery.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.525,"raw":6.225,"lead":0.425,"words":[["One,",0.425,0.675],["swim",0.7375,1.1125],["for",1.1125,1.325],["it:",1.325,1.575],["fifty-six",1.6875,2.4],["against",2.4,2.7875],["your",2.7875,2.975],["three.",2.975,3.575],["That's",3.7125,4.0],["not",4.0,4.1875],["a",4.1875,4.2875],["race,",4.2875,4.7],["it's",4.75,4.9125],["a",4.9125,4.975],["delivery.",4.975,5.95]]},"c03":{"text":"Two, climb onto something, a rock, a buoy, your flipped kayak. You've seen what they do to things on top of the water. Up there, you're the seal.","speed":0.96,"dur":9.35,"raw":10.0,"lead":0.375,"words":[["Two,",0.375,0.65],["climb",0.7,1.0],["onto",1.0,1.3875],["something,",1.3875,1.9],["a",1.975,2.0875],["rock,",2.0875,2.5],["a",2.6,2.725],["buoy,",2.725,3.125],["your",3.175,3.375],["flipped",3.375,3.7375],["kayak.",3.7375,4.625],["You've",4.7625,4.9875],["seen",4.9875,5.3],["what",5.3,5.45],["they",5.45,5.6375],["do",5.6375,5.825],["to",5.825,5.975],["things",5.975,6.3625],["on",6.3625,6.55],["top",6.55,6.8125],["of",6.8125,6.8875],["the",6.8875,7.0125],["water.",7.0125,7.75],["Up",7.9125,8.1375],["there,",8.1375,8.475],["you're",8.55,8.75],["the",8.75,8.9125],["seal.",8.9125,9.725]]},"c04":{"text":"Three, dive and hide. Remember, they hunt by listening, and you kicking down on burning lungs are exactly the noise they want.","speed":0.96,"dur":8.375,"raw":9.05,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Three,",0.4,0.8],["dive",0.8875,1.2875],["and",1.2875,1.4125],["hide.",1.4125,2.25],["Remember,",2.4125,2.975],["they",3.05,3.2125],["hunt",3.2125,3.5],["by",3.5,3.7125],["listening,",3.7125,4.45],["and",4.525,4.65],["you",4.65,4.8125],["kicking",4.8125,5.175],["down",5.175,5.4875],["on",5.4875,5.6875],["burning",5.6875,6.1125],["lungs",6.1125,6.55],["are",6.55,6.675],["exactly",6.675,7.275],["the",7.275,7.4125],["noise",7.4125,7.85],["they",7.85,8.0125],["want.",8.0125,8.775]]},"c05":{"text":"Four, play dead. If the theory is right, that's roughly what a flipped great white does. Ask its liver how that went.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.65,"raw":8.35,"lead":0.425,"words":[["Four,",0.425,0.75],["play",0.8,1.0875],["dead.",1.0875,1.75],["If",1.875,2.05],["the",2.05,2.2],["theory",2.2,2.575],["is",2.575,2.7375],["right,",2.7375,3.075],["that's",3.125,3.4625],["roughly",3.4625,3.875],["what",3.875,4.0125],["a",4.0125,4.1375],["flipped",4.1375,4.5375],["great",4.5375,4.8875],["white",4.8875,5.2],["does.",5.2,5.875],["Ask",6.05,6.4125],["its",6.4125,6.6125],["liver",6.6125,6.95],["how",6.95,7.125],["that",7.125,7.3875],["went.",7.3875,8.075]]},"c06":{"text":"Four moves, four losses. Once a pod picks you, the outcome is not up to you.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.3,"raw":6.0,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Four",0.4,0.6375],["moves,",0.6375,1.1],["four",1.1625,1.45],["losses.",1.45,2.425],["Once",2.5625,2.8125],["a",2.8125,2.8875],["pod",2.8875,3.2875],["picks",3.2875,3.6],["you,",3.6,3.75],["the",3.7875,3.9375],["outcome",3.9375,4.425],["is",4.425,4.575],["not",4.575,4.7875],["up",4.7875,4.9875],["to",4.9875,5.1375],["you.",5.1375,5.7]]},"t01":{"text":"And yet no wild pod has ever made that pick.","speed":0.96,"dur":3.1,"raw":3.75,"lead":0.375,"words":[["And",0.375,0.525],["yet",0.525,0.7875],["no",0.7875,1.0625],["wild",1.0625,1.4625],["pod",1.4625,1.8375],["has",1.8375,2.0125],["ever",2.0125,2.275],["made",2.275,2.525],["that",2.525,2.7875],["pick.",2.7875,3.475]]},"t03":{"text":"Off Spain and Portugal since 2020, some pods have rammed sailboats and snapped off their rudders, and a few boats sank.","speed":0.96,"dur":8.3,"raw":8.975,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Off",0.4,0.6125],["Spain",0.6125,1.0625],["and",1.0625,1.1875],["Portugal",1.1875,1.725],["since",1.725,1.95],["2020,",1.95,3.025],["some",3.1875,3.4625],["pods",3.4625,3.9125],["have",3.9125,4.1125],["rammed",4.1125,4.55],["sailboats",4.55,5.25],["and",5.25,5.4],["snapped",5.4,5.8],["off",5.8,6.025],["their",6.025,6.2125],["rudders,",6.2125,7.025],["and",7.125,7.2375],["a",7.2375,7.3125],["few",7.3125,7.5625],["boats",7.5625,7.925],["sank.",7.925,8.7]]},"t04":{"text":"Even then they swim off once the rudder's gone, and nobody aboard has been seriously hurt.","speed":0.96,"dur":6.05,"raw":6.725,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Even",0.4,0.675],["then",0.675,0.975],["they",0.975,1.15],["swim",1.15,1.5],["off",1.5,1.775],["once",1.775,2.025],["the",2.025,2.15],["rudder's",2.15,2.5625],["gone,",2.5625,3.325],["and",3.4625,3.6],["nobody",3.6,4.125],["aboard",4.125,4.6],["has",4.6,4.8],["been",4.8,5.0375],["seriously",5.0375,5.7375],["hurt.",5.7375,6.45]]},"t05":{"text":"You're slow, soft, and floating in their kitchen, and still they swim past.","speed":0.96,"dur":4.675,"raw":5.35,"lead":0.375,"words":[["You're",0.375,0.55],["slow,",0.55,1.025],["soft,",1.15,1.525],["and",1.5625,1.6875],["floating",1.6875,2.0875],["in",2.0875,2.1625],["their",2.1625,2.3375],["kitchen,",2.3375,3.075],["and",3.175,3.3125],["still",3.3125,3.65],["they",3.65,3.825],["swim",3.825,4.2125],["past.",4.2125,5.05]]},"t06":{"text":"So why? Nobody knows for certain, but two things help.","speed":0.96,"dur":3.325,"raw":4.05,"lead":0.425,"words":[["So",0.425,0.6125],["why?",0.6125,1.05],["Nobody",1.1875,1.55],["knows",1.55,1.875],["for",1.875,2.0375],["certain,",2.0375,2.35],["but",2.3875,2.5375],["two",2.5375,2.7625],["things",2.7625,3.075],["help.",3.075,3.75]]},"t07":{"text":"Shark bites on people are often thought to be mistakes, because from below, you on a board look a lot like a seal.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.45,"raw":8.175,"lead":0.45,"words":[["Shark",0.45,0.7625],["bites",0.7625,1.15],["on",1.15,1.35],["people",1.35,1.725],["are",1.725,1.9],["often",1.9,2.3125],["thought",2.3125,2.55],["to",2.55,2.6375],["be",2.6375,2.775],["mistakes,",2.775,3.725],["because",3.85,4.2],["from",4.2,4.4],["below,",4.4,5.1],["you",5.2875,5.45],["on",5.45,5.5875],["a",5.5875,5.7],["board",5.7,6.125],["look",6.125,6.35],["a",6.35,6.4625],["lot",6.4625,6.775],["like",6.775,6.9625],["a",6.9625,7.0875],["seal.",7.0875,7.9]]},"t08":{"text":"Orcas don't work that way. Remember, they check first, looking and listening, so that mistake is much harder to make.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.575,"raw":8.25,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Orcas",0.4,0.825],["don't",0.825,1.075],["work",1.075,1.325],["that",1.325,1.575],["way.",1.575,2.225],["Remember,",2.4125,2.95],["they",3.025,3.25],["check",3.25,3.55],["first,",3.55,4.075],["looking",4.1875,4.625],["and",4.625,4.75],["listening,",4.75,5.425],["so",5.5,5.675],["that",5.675,5.875],["mistake",5.875,6.375],["is",6.375,6.525],["much",6.525,6.7625],["harder",6.7625,7.2],["to",7.2,7.325],["make.",7.325,7.975]]},"t09":{"text":"And what they check has to be on the family menu, because an orca eats what its grandmother taught its mother to eat.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.0,"raw":7.65,"lead":0.375,"words":[["And",0.375,0.5125],["what",0.5125,0.65],["they",0.65,0.875],["check",0.875,1.2],["has",1.2,1.4],["to",1.4,1.525],["be",1.525,1.775],["on",1.775,1.9125],["the",1.9125,2.0125],["family",2.0125,2.475],["menu,",2.475,3.2],["because",3.35,3.7],["an",3.7,3.875],["orca",3.875,4.4],["eats",4.4,4.725],["what",4.725,4.8625],["its",4.8625,5.0625],["grandmother",5.0625,5.7625],["taught",5.7625,6.0375],["its",6.0375,6.2375],["mother",6.2375,6.575],["to",6.575,6.7125],["eat.",6.7125,7.375]]},"t10":{"text":"Fish-eating pods off Canada swim past seals without a second look, and mammal hunters learn which mammals count, like those Weddell-choosing pods.","speed":0.96,"dur":10.225,"raw":10.9,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Fish-eating",0.4,0.9125],["pods",0.9125,1.35],["off",1.35,1.5875],["Canada",1.5875,2.1375],["swim",2.1375,2.5625],["past",2.5625,3.0],["seals",3.0,3.5],["without",3.5,3.7875],["a",3.7875,3.8875],["second",3.8875,4.25],["look,",4.25,4.9],["and",5.0375,5.175],["mammal",5.175,5.55],["hunters",5.55,6.0375],["learn",6.0375,6.45],["which",6.45,6.6875],["mammals",6.6875,7.1625],["count,",7.1625,7.875],["like",8.0,8.225],["those",8.225,8.7625],["Weddell-choosing",8.7625,9.6625],["pods.",9.6625,10.625]]},"t11":{"text":"In all those generations of handed-down menus, you have never made the list.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.1,"raw":5.8,"lead":0.4,"words":[["In",0.4,0.5375],["all",0.5375,0.8],["those",0.8,1.1125],["generations",1.1125,1.925],["of",1.925,2.0625],["handed-down",2.0625,2.825],["menus,",2.825,3.625],["you",3.75,3.9],["have",3.9,4.1125],["never",4.1125,4.425],["made",4.425,4.6375],["the",4.6375,4.725],["list.",4.725,5.5]]},"t12":{"text":"So the quiet under your kayak was a check, silent while they look and chatty once they've decided.","speed":0.96,"dur":6.2,"raw":6.9,"lead":0.4,"words":[["So",0.4,0.575],["the",0.575,0.7125],["quiet",0.7125,1.175],["under",1.175,1.4],["your",1.4,1.5625],["kayak",1.5625,2.075],["was",2.075,2.225],["a",2.225,2.35],["check,",2.35,3.05],["silent",3.2375,3.8],["while",3.8,4.0],["they",4.0,4.1875],["look",4.1875,4.475],["and",4.475,4.6125],["chatty",4.6125,5.0625],["once",5.0625,5.4],["they've",5.4,5.625],["decided.",5.625,6.6]]},"t13":{"text":"They checked, and you weren't food.","speed":0.96,"dur":1.9,"raw":2.575,"lead":0.375,"words":[["They",0.375,0.575],["checked,",0.575,0.975],["and",1.0125,1.125],["you",1.125,1.25],["weren't",1.25,1.5],["food.",1.5,2.275]]},"v01":{"text":"Which leaves three words from the start: in the wild.","speed":0.96,"dur":3.275,"raw":3.95,"lead":0.375,"words":[["Which",0.375,0.575],["leaves",0.575,0.9125],["three",0.9125,1.2],["words",1.2,1.525],["from",1.525,1.6625],["the",1.6625,1.7625],["start:",1.7625,2.4],["in",2.5375,2.6625],["the",2.6625,2.7875],["wild.",2.7875,3.65]]},"v02":{"text":"Every human death ever linked to an orca happened in a marine park, with animals taken from the sea or born in tanks. There have been four.","speed":0.96,"dur":9.425,"raw":10.1,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Every",0.4,0.7125],["human",0.7125,1.1125],["death",1.1125,1.4875],["ever",1.4875,1.8125],["linked",1.8125,2.125],["to",2.125,2.2125],["an",2.2125,2.3375],["orca",2.3375,2.7375],["happened",2.7375,3.2],["in",3.2,3.2875],["a",3.2875,3.35],["marine",3.35,3.8625],["park,",3.8625,4.55],["with",4.65,4.85],["animals",4.85,5.3875],["taken",5.3875,5.775],["from",5.775,5.9375],["the",5.9375,6.0875],["sea",6.0875,6.5875],["or",6.5875,6.775],["born",6.775,7.25],["in",7.25,7.4125],["tanks.",7.4125,8.325],["There",8.4625,8.6125],["have",8.6125,8.75],["been",8.75,8.9875],["four.",8.9875,9.825]]},"v03":{"text":"Out in the open, the harm mostly flows from people like you and me to them.","speed":0.96,"dur":4.725,"raw":5.4,"lead":0.4,"words":[["Out",0.4,0.5625],["in",0.5625,0.6375],["the",0.6375,0.7875],["open,",0.7875,1.475],["the",1.6,1.7375],["harm",1.7375,2.15],["mostly",2.15,2.5375],["flows",2.5375,2.975],["from",2.975,3.175],["people",3.175,3.55],["like",3.55,3.7875],["you",3.7875,4.0],["and",4.0,4.125],["me",4.125,4.3375],["to",4.3375,4.5],["them.",4.5,5.125]]},"v04":{"text":"In the 1960s and 70s, dozens of orcas were caught or killed around Puget Sound for aquarium shows.","speed":0.96,"dur":7.775,"raw":8.45,"lead":0.4,"words":[["In",0.4,0.4875],["the",0.4875,0.575],["1960s",0.575,1.625],["and",1.625,1.7625],["70s,",1.7625,2.775],["dozens",2.9125,3.2875],["of",3.2875,3.4125],["orcas",3.4125,3.875],["were",3.875,4.0375],["caught",4.0375,4.4625],["or",4.4625,4.65],["killed",4.65,5.1875],["around",5.1875,5.6125],["Puget",5.6125,6.0375],["Sound",6.0375,6.475],["for",6.475,6.6],["aquarium",6.6,7.25],["shows.",7.25,8.175]]},"v05":{"text":"The Southern Residents who live there today number about seventy-five, down from ninety-eight in 1995, roughly one school bus full.","speed":0.96,"dur":9.825,"raw":10.475,"lead":0.375,"words":[["The",0.375,0.5],["Southern",0.5,0.925],["Residents",0.925,1.4125],["who",1.4125,1.5625],["live",1.5625,1.8],["there",1.8,2.0125],["today",2.0125,2.6125],["number",2.6125,3.025],["about",3.025,3.375],["seventy-five,",3.375,4.65],["down",4.7875,5.15],["from",5.15,5.35],["ninety-eight",5.35,6.025],["in",6.025,6.15],["1995,",6.15,7.75],["roughly",7.9125,8.3625],["one",8.3625,8.6875],["school",8.6875,9.05],["bus",9.05,9.4],["full.",9.4,10.2]]},"v06":{"text":"Their salmon is vanishing, ship noise drowns out the clicks they hunt it with, and their blubber holds some of the highest chemical loads of any marine mammal.","speed":0.96,"dur":9.925,"raw":10.575,"lead":0.375,"words":[["Their",0.375,0.6125],["salmon",0.6125,1.075],["is",1.075,1.2375],["vanishing,",1.2375,2.175],["ship",2.325,2.6],["noise",2.6,3.0375],["drowns",3.0375,3.475],["out",3.475,3.675],["the",3.675,3.8125],["clicks",3.8125,4.175],["they",4.175,4.325],["hunt",4.325,4.5375],["it",4.5375,4.675],["with,",4.675,5.325],["and",5.4625,5.5875],["their",5.5875,5.7625],["blubber",5.7625,6.1625],["holds",6.1625,6.5375],["some",6.5375,6.7125],["of",6.7125,6.7875],["the",6.7875,6.925],["highest",6.925,7.4625],["chemical",7.4625,7.9375],["loads",7.9375,8.45],["of",8.45,8.65],["any",8.65,8.975],["marine",8.975,9.45],["mammal.",9.45,10.3]]},"v07":{"text":"Nothing in the sea hunts the orca. The closest thing it has to a predator is us.","speed":0.96,"dur":5.3,"raw":6.025,"lead":0.45,"words":[["Nothing",0.45,0.825],["in",0.825,0.9375],["the",0.9375,1.0875],["sea",1.0875,1.4375],["hunts",1.4375,1.775],["the",1.775,1.9375],["orca.",1.9375,2.675],["The",2.8625,3.0125],["closest",3.0125,3.525],["thing",3.525,3.75],["it",3.75,3.85],["has",3.85,4.15],["to",4.15,4.275],["a",4.275,4.3875],["predator",4.3875,4.8875],["is",4.8875,5.075],["us.",5.075,5.75]]},"e01":{"text":"Back to your kayak. The water's glassy, the inlet's cold.","speed":0.88,"dur":4.125,"raw":4.85,"lead":0.425,"words":[["Back",0.425,0.675],["to",0.675,0.7625],["your",0.7625,0.9125],["kayak.",0.9125,1.725],["The",1.85,1.975],["water's",1.975,2.4125],["glassy,",2.4125,2.975],["the",3.0125,3.15],["inlet's",3.15,3.6125],["cold.",3.6125,4.55]]},"e02":{"text":"The squeaking starts up again, louder, and the pod slides by close enough to hear them breathe.","speed":0.88,"dur":6.4,"raw":7.1,"lead":0.4,"words":[["The",0.4,0.5],["squeaking",0.5,1.0],["starts",1.0,1.3375],["up",1.3375,1.525],["again,",1.525,2.2],["louder,",2.375,3.225],["and",3.3625,3.4875],["the",3.4875,3.5875],["pod",3.5875,3.9875],["slides",3.9875,4.5],["by",4.5,4.6875],["close",4.6875,5.0375],["enough",5.0375,5.325],["to",5.325,5.45],["hear",5.45,5.6625],["them",5.6625,5.8625],["breathe.",5.8625,6.8]]},"e03":{"text":"The rule you paddled out with still holds. In the wild, zero.","speed":0.88,"dur":4.55,"raw":5.275,"lead":0.4,"words":[["The",0.4,0.5375],["rule",0.5375,0.875],["you",0.875,1.0375],["paddled",1.0375,1.5],["out",1.5,1.7125],["with",1.7125,1.875],["still",1.875,2.1875],["holds.",2.1875,3.1],["In",3.2625,3.3875],["the",3.3875,3.5125],["wild,",3.5125,4.025],["zero.",4.0875,4.95]]},"e04":{"text":"But the animal passing you outsizes you, outruns you, plans ahead, washes seals off ice, empties great whites and brings down blue whales.","speed":0.88,"dur":10.875,"raw":11.55,"lead":0.375,"words":[["But",0.375,0.4875],["the",0.4875,0.65],["animal",0.65,1.1375],["passing",1.1375,1.625],["you",1.625,1.8],["outsizes",1.8,2.5875],["you,",2.5875,3.05],["outruns",3.2375,3.95],["you,",3.95,4.1],["plans",4.1875,4.6],["ahead,",4.6,5.375],["washes",5.55,6.075],["seals",6.075,6.525],["off",6.525,6.8125],["ice,",6.8125,7.525],["empties",7.6875,8.2125],["great",8.2125,8.5875],["whites",8.5875,9.05],["and",9.05,9.175],["brings",9.175,9.5375],["down",9.5375,9.9125],["blue",9.9125,10.2125],["whales.",10.2125,11.25]]},"e05":{"text":"And it just looked you over, then kept swimming.","speed":0.88,"dur":2.9,"raw":3.6,"lead":0.4,"words":[["And",0.4,0.5375],["it",0.5375,0.625],["just",0.625,0.875],["looked",0.875,1.1],["you",1.1,1.2625],["over,",1.2625,1.725],["then",1.8,2.05],["kept",2.05,2.375],["swimming.",2.375,3.3]]},"e06":{"text":"Orcas could hunt you. They decided not to.","speed":0.88,"dur":2.95,"raw":3.875,"lead":0.45,"words":[["Orcas",0.45,0.875],["could",0.875,1.05],["hunt",1.05,1.3625],["you.",1.3625,1.75],["They",1.9,2.075],["decided",2.075,2.625],["not",2.625,2.925],["to.",2.925,3.4]]},"e07":{"text":"And the only thing keeping you off that menu is a habit, in an animal that keeps picking up new ones.","speed":0.88,"dur":7.175,"raw":7.9,"lead":0.425,"words":[["And",0.425,0.5625],["the",0.5625,0.7],["only",0.7,1.125],["thing",1.125,1.4375],["keeping",1.4375,1.85],["you",1.85,2.0125],["off",2.0125,2.275],["that",2.275,2.5375],["menu",2.5375,3.25],["is",3.25,3.425],["a",3.425,3.55],["habit,",3.55,4.45],["in",4.5875,4.7125],["an",4.7125,4.8875],["animal",4.8875,5.375],["that",5.375,5.5875],["keeps",5.5875,5.9375],["picking",5.9375,6.2875],["up",6.2875,6.4875],["new",6.4875,6.725],["ones.",6.725,7.6]]},"x01":{"text":"Next file: leopard seal or box jellyfish? Pick one in the comments.","speed":0.88,"dur":5.0,"raw":5.725,"lead":0.45,"words":[["Next",0.45,0.7625],["file:",0.7625,1.175],["leopard",1.2625,1.7125],["seal",1.7125,2.15],["or",2.15,2.3125],["box",2.3125,2.7],["jellyfish?",2.7,3.675],["Pick",3.8375,4.1],["one",4.1,4.2875],["in",4.2875,4.3625],["the",4.3625,4.4625],["comments.",4.4625,5.45]]}}